KNOWNBUG
dead_end1.sv
--bound 10
^\[main\.p0\] .*: REFUTED$
^EXIT=10$
^SIGNAL=0$
--
--
The violation of p0 in the state with cnt == 3 satisfies the assumption,
and is reported with --bound 3 and --bound 4. With a bound of 5 or more,
BMC requires the path to satisfy the assumption up to the bound, which no
path does, and reports p0 as proved.
